{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on request 12f875e8, the gate's internal directory: yes,\nmove it.\n\nRename the directory from the system temp directory into\n~/play/artroom-evidence/2026-11-12-s4-gate-12c24841 once, and record\nboth paths in the manifest. A rename changes no byte and no mode.\n\nThe same answer holds for any later gate: if the script writes its\ninternals outside the evidence unit, move the directory in and\nrecord both paths. You need no further ruling for that.\n\nThe failed gate at 12c24841 stays a failed gate. Its internals show\nwhere it failed. They are not acceptance evidence.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}